/*
  Cloudflare Pages _redirects
  - Directory access without trailing slash → add slash (which serves /index.html)
  - /server → /category (legacy alias)

  Astro with trailingSlash: 'never' emits /foo/index.html; request /foo returns 404.
  This redirect forces the trailing slash for directory routes so internal links work.
*/

/server         /category           301

/category       /category/          301
/client         /client/            301
/blog           /blog/              301

/best           /best/              301
/about          /about/             301
/search         /search/            301